{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>《Grainy Filter Vintage: PhotoML》是一款專為 iPhone 與 iPad 打造的 Lo-fi 菲林相機及編輯器，可將相片和影片轉換成充滿懷舊感的復古作品，適合喜愛菲林顆粒、模擬菲林色調與舊日錄影帶質感的創作者。原價 US $9.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>重現菲林顆粒質感</h2>\n<p>PhotoML 的招牌顆粒效果能為相片與影片加入細緻的模擬菲林質感，同時內置 Aerochrome、VHS、8mm、Lomo、紅外線、黑白與復古等多款濾鏡，涵蓋紅外線色調、錄影帶失真、漏光、暗角、高飽和色彩及高對比效果，讓畫面更具懷舊電影感，重現舊日菲林的獨特氛圍。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-501-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-502-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-503-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-504-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-505-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/2732x2048bb-4-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Grainy Filter Vintage: PhotoML</li>\n<li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-08T01:29:21.284149+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":352,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}